# Control Plane Patterns

## Architecture
FastAPI + SQLAlchemy + AsyncPG + Alembic

## Adding Features
- Routes: `control/api/routes/`
- Schemas: `control/schemas/` (Pydantic)
- Logic: `control/services/`
- Models: `control/models/` (SQLAlchemy)
- Migrations: `alembic revision --autogenerate -m "description"`

## Commands
```bash
cd control
uv run uvicorn control.app:create_app --factory --reload
uv run pytest tests/ -v --cov=control
uv run ruff check .
```
